        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Solid Brass (.050\" Thick)  6\" High Kick Plate\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese are made of .050\" Thick Solid Brass and come with matching finish mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 6 Inch tall door kick plates are available in lengths from 28\" - 42\" and 3 different high quality finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>\r\nKick Plates are typically the width of the door less 2 inches.  If your door is 36 inches wide you would install a 34 inch wide kick plate. Please measure each door for proper fit.</i>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Other great door kick plates available:</b><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-high-solid-brass-door-kick-plates\">8\" High Solid Brass</a> <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-high-stainless-steel-door-kick-plates\">6\" High Stainless Steel</a> <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-high-stainless-steel-door-kick-plates\">8\" High Stainless Steel</a> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
